ree jars that start differently`),Q(2,`look-alike jars: read past the first sound`)]},{id:`read-soft-c-g`,subject:`reading`,name:`Words with a soft c or g`,friend:`kitty`,needs:{skill:`read-digraphs`,rung:1},next:`spell-word`,rungs:[Q(2,`three jars that start differently`),Q(2,`look-alike jars: read past the first sound`),Q(3,`longer words: syllables, prefixes and endings`,!1)]},{id:`read-order`,subject:`reading`,name:`Reading a guest's order`,friend:`kitty`,known:!0,evidence:`exposure`,next:`read-note`,rungs:[Q(1,`digits, one or two kinds, read aloud`),Q(1,`digits, read first`),Q(2,`number words`),Q(2,`three kinds, and something they do not want`),Q(3,`an order in two sentences`,!1)]},{id:`recipe-order`,subject:`language`,name:`Putting the recipe in order`,friend:`kitty`,known:!0,next:`read-note`,rungs:[Q(1,`three steps, with pictures`),Q(1,`four steps, with pictures`),Q(2,`words only`),Q(2,`five steps, words only`)]},{id:`missing-addend`,subject:`maths`,name:`How many more?`,friend:`bunny`,rungs:[Q(1,`up to 5: count the empty spots on the dish`),Q(1,`up to 10: count on from what is there`),Q(1,`to ten: the pairs that make ten`),Q(1,`teens: make the ten, then the rest`),Q(2,`the same with no picture`,!1),Q(2,`how many more to match a friend`,!1),Q(2,`two digits: hop to the next ten first`,!1),Q(2,`across a hundred`,!1),Q(3,`equal groups first, then the missing part`,!1),Q(4,`the same with tables to 9 by 9`,!1)],next:`make-ten`},{id:`make-ten`,subject:`maths`,name:`Making a ten to add and take away`,friend:`bunny`,next:`doubles`,rungs:[Q(1,`fill the tray of ten: the pairs that make ten`),Q(1,`more than fit: how many fill the first tray?`),Q(1,`how many in all: fill the ten, then the rest (8 + 5)`),Q(1,`taking away through ten: the loose ones first (14 − 6)`),Q(2,`adding 9: a full tray, then take one off`),Q(2,`two digits and ones: make the next ten first (47 + 6)`),Q(2,`ten trays of ten make 100: how many more trays?`),Q(2,`any number to 100: the next ten, then tens